      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HEZ SO ROYAL (8) has been racing in outstanding form and made it another victory last time, scoring narrowly over 2230m here. The draw isn't ideal, but he has the sprint lane to utilise and possesses the ability to make it back-to-back wins. IM ALL BUSINESS (6) was a winner here 2 starts ago before a tough draw contributed to a below-par fourth at Port Pirie. Back against a similar line-up, he can bounce back sharply. HEEZ A VIBE (5) produced an encouraging third over this track and trip last start and looks a genuine threat with further improvement. DEUCE COUPE NZ (1) was disappointing when eighth last time, but his best form is good enough for this and the inside draw gives him every chance to rebound. Include in all top 4 combos.",
